      "text": [
        "ه عن العبّاس بن هلال فقد رويته عن الحسين بن إبراهيم بن ناتانة- رضي اللّه عنه- عن عليّ بن إبراهيم، عن أبيه، عن العبّاس بن هلال‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Al-Abbas ibn Hilal has been transmitted by me from Al-Husayn ibn Ibrahim ibn Natanah - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Al-Abbas ibn Hilal."
        ]
      }
